                "title": "PS24298 Computer Supply and Demand Model",
                "description": "***** THIS IS AN AWARD NOTICE, NOT A CALL FOR COMPETITION *****\r\n\r\nThis procurement is being concluded following a mini competition under the CCS DPS RM6200 Artificial Intelligence (AI) \r\n\r\nBrief Description of Requirement\r\n\r\nDepartment for Science, Innovation & Technology (DSIT) have a requirement to build a compute supply and demand model to directly inform the Compute Strategy around whether there is a gap in capacity, where and for what. This project will involve creating a supply and demand scenario model for future compute infrastructure in the UK.",
